    "text": "fayettevilleflyer.com\nwebsite\nFayetteville\nNew Experience Fayetteville CEO begins role, reception planned\nBy Stacy Ryburn,\n9 hours agoFAYETTEVILLE — The city’s new tourism director started his job this week. Ryan Hauck, who previously served as executive director of Cody Yellowstone, began his role as CEO of Experience Fayetteville on Monday, according to a news release from the agency. Experience Fayetteville is the city’s tourism bureau and is governed by the Advertising and Promotion Commission.",
